---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { useTranslations } from '../i18n/ui';

const t = useTranslations('en');
---

<LegalLayout
  lang="en"
  title={t.meta.privacy.title}
  description={t.meta.privacy.description}
  path="/privacy/"
  heading="Privacy Statement"
  updated="Last updated: July 2026"
>
  <p>
    This statement describes what personal information the leviora.ai website collects and
    how it is used. It is intentionally short, because the site collects very little.
  </p>

  <h2>1. What we collect</h2>
  <p>
    The only personal information you can submit on this site is the demo request form:
    name, email address, phone number, company and an optional message. In addition, our
    web servers keep standard technical logs (IP address, request time, requested page)
    for security and troubleshooting.
  </p>

  <h2>2. No cookies, no tracking</h2>
  <p>
    leviora.ai does not use cookies, analytics scripts, advertising pixels or any other
    tracking technology. There is no consent banner because there is nothing to consent
    to.
  </p>

  <h2>3. How your information is used</h2>
  <p>
    Form data is used solely to respond to your request and plan a demo or pilot. It is
    delivered to our inbox through an email infrastructure provider acting on our behalf.
    We do not sell personal information and we do not share it for third-party marketing.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Retention and security</h2>
  <p>
    If no business relationship is established, form data is deleted no later than 24
    months after your request is closed. The site is served over HTTPS and form
    submissions are rate-limited and filtered against abuse.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Your rights and contact</h2>
  <p>
    Details of your rights and their legal bases are set out in our
    <a href="/kvkk/">Data Protection Notice (GDPR)</a> and, for Türkiye, in the
    <a href="/tr/kvkk/">KVKK Aydınlatma Metni</a>. For any privacy request, write to
    <a href="mailto:info@leviora.ai">info@leviora.ai</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
